      {
        "type": "p",
        "runs": [
          ["The Adios customer app is a mobile application. ", false],
          ["Mobile apps do not use browser cookies.", true],
          [
            " Instead, the app uses similar technologies: storage on your device, software development kits (SDKs) and device identifiers. This Policy explains each technology we use, why we use it, how long the data lasts and how you can control it. Browser cookies are relevant only when you visit an Adios web page, such as a shared restaurant menu link or our website; Section 5 covers those. This Policy should be read with the Adios User Privacy Policy.",
            false
          ]
        ]
      }
