          {
            "type": "p",
            "runs": [
              ["2.1 ", false],
              ["When it runs.", true],
              [
                " Only when you are online. When you go online for the first time, the Driver app explains why background location is needed and then asks for the \"Allow all the time\" permission. While tracking is active, Android shows a persistent notification (\"Adios Driver active\") and iOS shows the location indicator.",
